			"notes": "## What's changed since v0.1.0-alpha.3\n\n- Improved live undo/redo capture around TNT, explosions, fluids, fire, falling blocks, and entity fallout.\n- Made restore and rollback flows safer: restore is undoable, stale redo/fallout capture is guarded, and zone/branch restore switching is more reliable.\n- Added guarded merge/support actions and fixed compare/merge previews for hidden fallout changes.\n- Improved entity history coverage for placed entities, armor stand equipment, entity-only pending changes, and action overlays.\n- Polished UI scaling, restore entity list sizing, zone creation hints, and Special Thanks rendering, including the Nayakochii skin asset.\n\n## Build\n\n- Minecraft 1.21.11, Fabric Loader 0.19.2.\n- Built from c229031f10ddbcc25028c0391bef83541aa5cae4.\n- Verified with `./gradlew.bat clean build` on Java 21.\n- SHA-256: `9F5D2E62BEA6D605408B5D5C13A5D58CB7D6D85CE6FFE888708F718FCFB29781`."
		},
