			"notes": "# Lumi alpha-0.1.0 - Testers #2\n\nChanges since Testers #1:\n- Improved live undo/redo ownership for TNT, redstone chains, explosions, and mob fallout.\n- Prevented replay-restored TNT from re-igniting through stale queued ticks and block events.\n- Added player-scoped undo/redo selection, queued Alt+Z/Alt+Y requests, and native-tool verification before history completion.\n- Improved restore/rollback reliability, player respawn restoration, and large overlay performance.\n- Completed localized UI coverage for English, Russian, German, Spanish, Finnish, and French.\n\nTarget:\n- Minecraft 1.21.11\n- Fabric Loader 0.19.2+\n- Fabric API 0.141.3+1.21.11\n- Java 21+\n\nAlpha note: keep normal world backups while testing."
